                                     raw accelerometer (g). Same font + size as the
                                     motor previews on the Controller tab: no
                                     FontFamily override, FontSize 14. Axis labels
                                     spelled out (Pitch / Yaw / Roll) instead of
                                     single-letter abbreviations. Per-axis Width is
                                     wide enough to hold the longest realistic value
                                     without text truncation. -->
                                <!-- Cold telemetry (#175 iteration 30): raw sensor truth
                                     inside an inset instrument panel, matching the trigger
                                     and motor instruments. -->
                                <Border Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ControlStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                                        BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12" Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left">
